## Skill or change

What does this improve, and when should the skill activate?

## Evidence

Describe a matching prompt, a non-matching prompt, expected behavior, and the bot/loader tested. Use synthetic data.

## Checklist

- [ ] The skill has valid name/description frontmatter and the name matches its folder.
- [ ] README catalog and llms.txt are updated if the catalog changed.
- [ ] No secrets, private data, internal links, or employer-specific content.
- [ ] No hidden actions, secret extraction, or approval bypass.
- [ ] Any adapted work keeps its source, copyright, and license notice.
- [ ] Integrations, permissions, executable assets, and limitations are documented.
- [ ] I have the right to contribute this under the repository's MIT License.
